@openai's #gptoss claims to be "natively" quantized in MXFP4. I believe it is actually quantization-aware training (QAT). This quantization method differs from native quantized training as seen in DeepSeek FP8, which quantizes both weights and computation during training.

Here is what I think actually happened during the training. Weights and computation are still in higher-precision, likely bf16, and MXFP4 is applied as fake quantization.

More explanation at my X post: https://lnkd.in/gnhzdhtt
